  "releaseNotes": "Enhance validation, docs, and Webcvs cancel support\n\n\t\t- Improved parameter validation: added DataType.MM, stricter checks for full-width/JIS0208, and aggregate error reporting.\n\t\t- Expanded FreeCsv validation, increased free_csv length limits, and updated invalid character set.\n\t\t- Webcvs API now supports CancelPayment; added CancelPaymentRequestData.\n\t\t- Updated PaymentMethod enum (docomo clarified, wechatpay added).\n\t\t- Improved README and added docs/index.md; clarified link-type request_date timeout.\n\t\t- Updated project metadata, resource files, and comments; marked LINE as obsolete.",
